---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact | Kvisl" description="Official contact information for Kvisl.">
  <main class="container page-main narrow-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Contact</h1>

    <div class="policy-copy">
      <p>The official general contact address for <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> is <a href="mailto:hello@kvisl.com">hello@kvisl.com</a>.</p>

      <div class="policy-contact-box">
        <strong>Email</strong>
        <a href="mailto:hello@kvisl.com">hello@kvisl.com</a>
      </div>

      <h2>Editorial enquiries</h2>
      <p>For editorial questions, pitches, corrections, or factual concerns, include the relevant article title and URL when applicable. Correction requests should identify the specific statement at issue and include reliable supporting information.</p>

      <h2>Republication and licensing</h2>
      <p>Use the <a href="/republish">Republish</a> form when possible. You may also contact us at the address above. Republication requires a paid licence and written approval before publication.</p>

      <h2>Copyright and other rights</h2>
      <p>For copyright, image rights, attribution, or related concerns, identify the relevant page, the material in question, your relationship to the rights, and a reliable way to reach you.</p>

      <h2>Privacy requests</h2>
      <p>Use the subject line “Privacy Request” and describe your request clearly. We may ask for reasonable information to verify your identity before taking action.</p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>If you discover a security issue, provide enough technical detail for us to investigate. Do not access, alter, download, or retain data beyond what is necessary to demonstrate the issue.</p>

      <h2>What we will never request</h2>
      <p><span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> will never ask you to send wallet private keys, seed phrases, passwords, or authentication codes by email, form, or direct message.</p>

      <h2>Verification</h2>
      <p>Rely only on contact information and payment details published on this website. If you receive a suspicious request claiming to come from <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span>, contact us before acting.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
